 "title": "The Credence Group",
 "description": "The Credence Group is a holding company managing a strategic portfolio of industry players across real estate, private lending, business acquisition, advisory and consulting services.",
 "image": "",
 "body": "<section class=\"hero-home\"><div class=\"container hero-home-inner\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Established Excellence</span>\n<h1>Diversified Excellence.<br><em>Unified Vision.</em></h1>\n<p>The Credence Group is a holding company managing a strategic portfolio of industry players across real estate, private lending, business acquisition, advisory and consulting services.</p>\n<div class=\"btn-row\"><a href=\"companies.html\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Explore Portfolio</a><a href=\"philosophy.html\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Strategy <svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\" /> <path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\" /></svg></a></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container two-col\">\n<div><h2>The Power of<br>Credence</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"prose\"><p>At The Credence Group, we don't just hold assets; we cultivate growth. As a parent organization, we provide the strategic oversight, capital, and shared values that allow our subsidiaries to operate in their respective markets.</p><p>From real estate development to the complexities of construction and business acquisition, our ecosystem is designed to deliver seamless excellence.</p></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"section bg-muted\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head split\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">Investment Pillars</span><h2>Our Portfolio</h2></div><p class=\"side\">Seven distinct sectors, one core philosophy of uncompromising quality.</p></div>\n<div class=\"port-grid\"><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\" /> <path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\" /></svg><h3>Real Estate</h3><p>Identifying and securing high-yield residential and commercial opportunities through rigorous market analysis.</p></div><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\" /> <path d=\"M10 8h4\" /> <path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\" /> <path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\" /> <path d=\"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16\" /></svg><h3>Realty</h3><p>Delivering real estate representation and advisory for clients.</p></div><div class=\"port-card featured\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\" /> <path d=\"M11.119 2.205a2 2 0 0 1 1.762 0l7.84 3.846A.5.5 0 0 1 20.5 7h-17a.5.5 0 0 1-.22-.949z\" /> <path d=\"M14 18v-7\" /> <path d=\"M18 18v-7\" /> <path d=\"M3 22h18\" /> <path d=\"M6 18v-7\" /></svg><h3>Design Build</h3><p>Leading land development, infill development, and construction-led design and execution.</p><a class=\"visit\" href=\"https://credencedesignbuild.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit Website <svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\" /> <path d=\"M10 14 21 3\" /> <path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\" /></svg></a></div><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M17 5H9.5a1 1 0 000 7h5a1 1 0 010 7H6\" /></svg><h3>Mortgages</h3><p>Structuring bespoke mortgage financing and private lending solutions to facilitate complex acquisitions.</p></div><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\" /> <path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\" /></svg><h3>Capital</h3><p>Deploying strategic capital and disciplined asset management to drive long-term equity growth.</p></div><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\" /> <rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\" /></svg><h3>Consulting</h3><p>Driving organizational excellence through specialized business advisory and transformation strategies.</p></div><div class=\"port-card\"><svg class=\"icon port-ico\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" /> <path d=\"M7 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M3 7.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M3 12h18\" /> <path d=\"M3 16.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M17 3v18\" /> <path d=\"M17 7.5h4\" /> <path d=\"M17 16.5h4\" /></svg><h3>Media</h3><p>Crafting high-impact narratives and digital positioning to amplify market presence and influence.</p><a class=\"visit\" href=\"https://credencemedia.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit Website <svg class=\"icon-sm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\" /> <path d=\"M10 14 21 3\" /> <path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\" /></svg></a></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head center\"><span class=\"eyebrow dark\">The Credence Advantage</span><h2>Why The Group?</h2></div>\n<div class=\"grid-3\">\n<div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\" /></svg></div><h3>The Credence Standard</h3><p>Each company is connected by a shared commitment to integrity, precision, and client-first results — the standard that defines every interaction across the group.</p></div>\n<div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\" /> <path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\" /> <path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\" /></svg></div><h3>Vertical Integration</h3><p>We control the full lifecycle of an asset — from acquisition through design, construction, sale, and financing — eliminating friction and maximizing value.</p></div>\n<div class=\"bordered\"><div class=\"ico-box\"><svg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\" /></svg></div><h3>Synergy in Motion</h3><p>By leveraging the internal strengths of our media, consulting, and capital arms, our real estate and construction projects move faster and perform better.</p></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"cta-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><h2>Integrity in Ownership.<br>Excellence in Execution.</h2><div class=\"btn-row center\"><a href=\"contact.html\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Get in Touch</a><a href=\"philosophy.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">Investment Philosophy</a></div></div></section>"
}